━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.poster.avif?t=1777071326\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.webm?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.mp4?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☢☢☢  HAVE FUN TOGETHER  ☢☢☢</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goof around, improvise — every run is your unique story with friends.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.poster.avif?t=1777071326\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.webm?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.mp4?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☢☢☢  AVOID TRAPS  ☢☢☢</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused and watch your step — one mistake can ruin the whole expedition.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.poster.avif?t=1777071326\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.webm?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.mp4?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☢☢☢  COLLECT RESOURCES  ☢☢☢</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect junk and important resources — every item can save you… or doom you.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.poster.avif?t=1777071326\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.webm?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.mp4?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☢☢☢  CRAFT ITEMS  ☢☢☢</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools and devices from everything you find. Upgrade your characters.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/4482c4b4be4d12c4ea9253ef5f4f048a.poster.avif?t=1777071326\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/4482c4b4be4d12c4ea9253ef5f4f048a.webm?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/4482c4b4be4d12c4ea9253ef5f4f048a.mp4?t=1777071326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online co-op up to 4 players<br></li><li>Co-op puzzles in bunkers<br></li><li>Monsters with unique behavior<br></li><li>Proximity voice chat — talk at a distance<br></li><li>Voice gameplay: code locks, doors<br></li><li>Monsters can hear you — your voice can reveal your position<br></li><li>Scream the code word to scare monsters away<br></li><li>Crafting from found junk: tools, devices, survival gear<br></li><li>Character upgrades<br></li><li>Kicks for chaos and sabotage<br></li><li>A train that must be fueled<br></li><li>Traps and hazards</li></ul>", "short_description": "A co-op extraction horror for 1-4 players where you survive nuclear wastelands on a train. Scavenge scrap for fuel and supplies, and use voice mechanics to stay alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Ukrainian, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Japanese, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/236fb92091e8ccef2e5c93fec52c25d643a7aa84/header.jpg?